		<title type="html"><![CDATA[Réponse à&#160;:  Récupération sous forme d'export table et data sans indexs]]></title>
		<link rel="alternate" href="http://forums.postgresql.fr/viewtopic.php?pid=15641#p15641"/>
		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<div class="codebox"><pre><code>CREATE OR REPLACE FUNCTION recup_index()
RETURNS void
AS $BODY$
DECLARE
test CURSOR FOR SELECT attrelid from pg_attribute where attrelid in (select oid from pg_class where relname in (select indexname from pg_indexes));
recup int;
BEGIN
recup := 0;
for recup in test loop
EXECUTE &#039;COPY (SELECT pg_get_indexdef(recup)) TO &#039;xxxxxxxxxx/testindex.sql&#039;&#039;;
end loop;
return;
end;
$BODY$
LANGUAGE plpgsql;</code></pre></div><p>Même erreur, je suis en 8.2.6</p><p>Merci Rjuju</p>]]></content>
