		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>Le plus simple si vous voulez l&#039;exporter est d&#039;utiliser COPY:</p><p>COPY (SELECT pg_get_indexdef(oid) FROM SELECT attrelid from pg_attribute where attrelid in (select oid from pg_class where relname in (select indexname from pg_indexes))) TO &#039;/path/fichier&#039;;</p>]]></content>
